</table>
</div>
<div id="S5.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S5.SS3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The agent began in Theme A in 100% of the trials and showed a strong overall preference for it, reading an average of 54.7% of Theme A letters. However, the variance across runs was higher than in Opus 4. In some sessions, the agent read up to 70% of Theme A letters, while in others, this dropped to around 30–35%.</p>
</div>
