</div>
<div id="S8.p11" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S8.p11.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S8.p11.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Appendix 2: Letters text</span>

<br class="ltx_break"><a href="https://github.com/valen-research/probing-llm-preferences/blob/5e51970e4d5f4d0cc6588a7ea7a0bd1500a74762/Appendix%202%20-%20Letters.pdf" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">Link</a></p>
</div>
